      "status": "observed",
      "summary": "Native parser and ulib integration tests compile larger Trit sources, so they are wired through next_compiler_native_ulib and tests_next_compiler_full rather than tests_next_fast; future module caching or incremental compilation can target this cost boundary."
    },
