      "id": "compiler.phase_c5.o0_o1_optimizer_guardrails",
      "status": "observed",
      "summary": "Phase C.5 bootstrap golden tests now compare OptimizationLevel::None and OptimizationLevel::Basic VM output for arithmetic, recursion, aggregate, atomic, pointer-state, and ulib_mini programs so optimizer changes have deterministic semantic guardrails."
